#: data/ui/preferences.blp:34
msgid ""
"Custom command runs a command of your choice, such as a particular browser, "
"outside the sandbox. It needs host access, a sandbox escape you grant "
"yourself with flatpak override. <a href='https://github.com/Tim-van-"
"Oudheusden/Dailies#custom-browser-command'>How to grant it and the risks</a>"
